      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000020262026000A600E3001600E9EBC8FA62026202600100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "涼脊龍好像很開心呢",
